OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by falling tree debris
OL,4,A'lucky to be alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum says she feels "lucky to be
OL,7,Falive" after she was hit on the head by
OL,8,Ffalling debris when part of a tree
OL,9,Fsnapped off during a storm.
OL,11,FNina Lunn was walking through Allestree
OL,12,FPark in Derby at about 11:00 BST on
OL,13,FSunday morning when Storm Boelo brought
OL,14,Fgusts of over 50mph to the East
OL,15,FMidlands.
OL,17,FThe injury caused bleeding and
OL,18,Fconcussion requiring hospital treatment
OL,19,Ffor the 42-year-old.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
