OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by falling tree debris
OL,4,A'lucky to be alive'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The hospital staff said 'wow, you're
OL,7,Flucky to be here'. The paramedics were
OL,8,Factually quite worried, especially
OL,9,Fbecause my blood pressure was very
OL,10,Fhigh," she told the BBC.
